abstract: >-
  Python utilities for seeded EMD and CEEMDAN decomposition, per-IMF
  instantaneous frequency and amplitude-weighted frequency summaries at
  signal peaks, zero-crossing checks, and Hilbert amplitude spectrograms.
keywords:
  - Hilbert-Huang transform
  - empirical mode decomposition
  - CEEMDAN
  - seismology
